{"id": "EUVD-2026-102981", "enisaUuid": "16ec8cfc-b656-3f2a-a470-9f1a88d5a938", "description": "Simple Admin Core through 1.8.7 contains an authentication bypass vulnerability that allows unauthenticated attackers to forge super administrator tokens by using the hard-coded Auth.AccessSecret in api/etc/core.yaml. Attackers can sign a JWT with the public secret and roleId claim 001 to gain full administrative control over users, roles, menus, API authorities, configuration and tokens.", "datePublished": "2026-10-16T17:39:46", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-19T13:35:10", "baseScore": 9.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:H/VI:H/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@hieuPenguinnn/simple-admin-core-hardcoded-jwt-accesssecret-admin-auth-bypass", "https://github.com/suyuan32/simple-admin-core/blob/v1.8.7/api/etc/core.yaml#L6-L8", "https://github.com/suyuan32/simple-admin-core/pull/382", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/simple-admin-core-through-1.8.7-hard-coded-jwt-secret-authentication-bypass"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-111690", "GHSA-m87p-c3h7-7hr8"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.44, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "4f3541f4-64b6-37fd-96a9-64eb753cd8c0", "product": {"name": "simple-admin-core", "vendor": {"name": "suyuan32"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22641.8.7"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "c8356bed-8d11-3a4b-b71c-8320e33fc7dd", "vendor": {"name": "suyuan32"}}], "isExploited": false}